UPDATE `hotfixes`.`broadcast_text` SET `Text`='Oculeth, I am relieved you made it here. Azshara is blocking my teleportation spells. We need to find a crack in her defenses. I know just the thing, Thalyssra. Come along, apprentice. You will serve as my assistant! If we combine our powers, we should be able to open a gateway to Zuldazar without Azshara noticing. Here we are. With the merest touch of the Heart of Azeroth, the pathway will be stabilized.' WHERE `ID`=910675;
