UPDATE `hotfixes`.`broadcast_text` SET `Text1`='<Viridia is a leader all her subordinates look up to. So much so that her old battalion follows her even without explicit orders when she moves on independently, free of the military high command. They trust her judgment and fight at her side to the end.\n\nViridia herself is kind-hearted and trained healers, not soldiers. She is a field healer, familiar with the strain and conditions of the battlefield. Yet she would rather heal than harm, and prefers a life of neutrality amid all the wars of this world.>' WHERE `ID`=213561;
